{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make authentic udon on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up bowls of udon noodles both hot and cold as quickly and accurately as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aRules\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make and serve as many bowls of udon as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil the noodles, pour the broth, then add the right toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to watch the portion sizes, and fill each order correctly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Check the order - Memorize the udon type and amount of noodles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Boil the noodles - Be careful not to mess up the amount!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Rinse the boiled noodles - Blanch them when making hot udon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add the toppings - Tempura, green onions, fried tofu, and more\u2014just follow the order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Serve it up - Get the order correct for the most points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Score Attack]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with players from all over the world for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Battle]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your udon-making skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>","background":"https://stor